{"id":"wb-7-1410","name":"门孜康","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"门孜康","text":"门孜康（藏语：སྨན་རྩིས་ཁང་，威利转写：sman rtsis khang，THL：men tsi khang），译为藏医历算学院或藏医星算学院，位于西藏自治区拉萨市城关区八廓街道，原是一座知名的藏医院，为今西藏自治区藏医院的前身之一。现在门孜康原有的建筑为古建筑大院。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%97%A8%E5%AD%9C%E5%BA%B7","revisionId":92804659,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92804659","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/95e34cbc587b0ee3155a878d.jpg","title":"Lhasa_Menzikang_2014.09.23_12-41-34.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lhasa_Menzikang_2014.09.23_12-41-34.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ef/Lhasa_Menzikang_2014.09.23_12-41-34.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"门孜康——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}